{"id":"ba6498424f41d0bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-graph-adjacency-matrix.md","title":"ZFC Graph Adjacency Matrix","display":"df-zfc-graph-adjacency-matrix — ZFC Graph Adjacency Matrix","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-adjacency-matrix","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-adjacency-matrix"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-adjacency-matrix — ZFC Graph Adjacency Matrix","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-graph]]","[[58-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-adjacency-matrix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-adjacency-matrix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-adjacency-matrix — ZFC Graph Adjacency Matrix"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"58-df-graph\">58-df-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"58-df-relation\">58-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq[X]^2\">\\(E\\subseteq[X]^2\\)</span> (vertex and edge sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq(X\\times X)\\times\\{0,1\\}\">\\(A\\subseteq(X\\times X)\\times\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (adjacency-matrix candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in X\">\\(u,v\\in X\\)</span> (vertices bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphAdjacencyMatrix}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphAdjacencyMatrix}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (graph and function predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}adjacency\\text{-}matrix} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphAdjacencyMatrix}_S(A,X,E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(\\langle X,E\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,X\\times X,\\{0,1\\})\\land\\forall u,v\\in X\\;\\bigl(A(\\langle u,v\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow\\{u,v\\}\\in E\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}adjacency\\text{-}matrix} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphAdjacencyMatrix}_S(A,X,E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(\\langle X,E\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,X\\times X,\\{0,1\\})\\land\\forall u,v\\in X\\;\\bigl(A(\\langle u,v\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow\\{u,v\\}\\in E\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The graph is validated and the matrix is a one-place function on ordered vertex pairs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-relation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq[X]^2","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq(X\\times X)\\times\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphAdjacencyMatrix}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S,\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}adjacency\\text{-}matrix} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphAdjacencyMatrix}_S(A,X,E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(\\langle X,E\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,X\\times X,\\{0,1\\})\\land\\forall u,v\\in X\\;\\bigl(A(\\langle u,v\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow\\{u,v\\}\\in E\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1124,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-graph-adjacency-matrix.md|58-df-zfc-graph-adjacency-matrix]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","0dc79ccc1050ee64","7ccfc8c88f29968a"]}